{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bff2373d4dc73f8663af1ce87c314f98954ce21989126a9782a333056e7d6976", "ja": "（アイドルたちによる、肝試し企画は無事終了。\n……したのだが、美奈子が戻ってこない）", "zh": "（偶像们的试胆企划顺利结束了。……本来应该是这样，可美奈子还没有回来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "2d9998e158c41b7970b3c8ac0b3da7f826f733e489a3ba98a5e7090ef157e6d4", "ja": "ううっ、みんな待ってるよね……。\n早く戻らなきゃ……。", "zh": "呜呜，大家都在等我吧……\n得快点回去才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1002_p", "source_sha256": "68d0ea3c416c68437ae5758fdc68a1cd3958756b1ae0a92bd06c7e2c013d2714", "ja": "美奈子、ここにいたのか……。", "zh": "美奈子，原来你在这里啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "e283f86aec3add12a9d95858617ff9fdb96dd31c9ed9be8b938296fa144ac36d", "ja": "きゃーーー！！", "zh": "呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "b054d44133c468aa51b2d78cdb2bf8a95e7d00918d6ad0d47be9d2d24c0fd744", "ja": "……って、{$P$}さん！？\nほ、本当に、お化けが出たのかと思いましたぁ……。", "zh": "……原来是{$P$}先生啊！？\n我还、还以为真的遇到妖怪了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1005_p", "source_sha256": "999dfae773ed46b5fea787db292e2bdedd04f8e7262c21dcd15a7d73d8561b87", "ja": "す、すまない。驚かせたようだな。\n美奈子が戻ってこないから心配でね。迎えにきたんだ。", "zh": "对、对不起。好像吓到你了。\n美奈子一直没回来，我有些担心，所以过来接你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "50361fef0961da725a9f42a41b1fcaebcd422a4ee1f422b31ed1979871549689", "ja": "そうだったんですね……うう、ゴメンなさい。\n本当は私も、すぐ戻ろうと思ったんですけど。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……呜呜，对不起。\n其实我也想马上回去的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "6f2beb4df40e5013f8c93a48190da66880c647cd8a39a84321f18301fc0f3489", "ja": "本番が終わったら、急に怖くなってきちゃって……。\n何か出て来そうじゃないですか、この雰囲気……。", "zh": "正式演出结束后，突然觉得好害怕……  \n这种气氛，不觉得好像会有什么东西冒出来吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f9f925c9cfacd4dd2930398db89351c36dd7c17de1ffc18271450dd5956b2633", "ja": "そうだったのか。美奈子はしっかりしてるし、\n一人でも大丈夫だと思ってしまって……ごめんな。", "zh": "原来是这样。因为觉得美奈子一向很可靠，就以为她一个人也没问题……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "7a73eca4d20fdbfb29d72228bfa240df427d3415687f1a012c02f2136afb4328", "ja": "謝らないでください！　私も一人で戻れるって思って\nましたし。こうして探しにきてくれたじゃないですか！", "zh": "请不要道歉！我也觉得自己一个人就能回去，\n而且你不是特地来找我了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f0d72d934f2fa401d5a9903d862d4e037386e7f9182acd29d3d8940ebcd693dd", "ja": "美奈子……。ここからは俺が付いてるからな。\n一緒にみんなのところへ戻ろう。", "zh": "美奈子……接下来我会陪着你的。我们一起回大家那里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "60ac5717ec66f82520ada22c3b7e43b3bc91c082f13bc8560fbbca47d00ab514", "ja": "はい！　……って言いたいんですけど。\n実は、まだ足が震えちゃってて……。だからその……。", "zh": "好的！……虽然很想这么说。\n其实，我的腿还在发抖……所以，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "6cdab8b2b83426431965c21324ba8bfb71d0b6324342eebeb41702d75115c055", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nて、手を繋いでもらえませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n可、可以请您牵着我的手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d368a448f7c562b54a1ac4f724d8e81c94449a34aa851e47d792e0ec3fd05274", "ja": "ああ、わかった。それで落ち着けるなら、\nいくらでも握ってくれていいよ。ほら。", "zh": "啊，知道了。如果这样能让你平静下来，想握多久都可以。来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "97482cfd473fbfd3ba5b2ca4305281f1d2f8776e0486e1db188190be2bbc85e4", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！　……ふふ、\n{$P$}さんの手、温かい。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您！……呵呵，{$P$}先生的手好温暖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0573_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "349a2d97a42ff84b84e933f4da49756946998f3323507de806be9719ee86dc69", "ja": "……あっ。ちょっとずつ、怖さがなくなってきました！\nやっぱり、頼もしいですね♪", "zh": "……啊。害怕的感觉，一点点地消失了！\n您果然很靠得住呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
